    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How Far Will You Go to Save the Ones You Love?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RalphGame is an action RPG that tells the tale of Ralph, a sailor who has to save his friends, stop an evil organization, and have fun doin' it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/2d81ff7142f69aba14cf2c77ee17996a.poster.avif?t=1738003482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/2d81ff7142f69aba14cf2c77ee17996a.webm?t=1738003482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/2d81ff7142f69aba14cf2c77ee17996a.mp4?t=1738003482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wrong place, wrong time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After being ambushed at sea during a routine excavation, Ralph wakes up to find himself on an island. Alone, hungry, and bald, his last memory is his friends being kidnapped as he's left to die at sea. I won't spoil whether or not Ralph dies in the first chapter so don't bother. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/7200fe3a9ec1547f783d3755581f5eb9.webp?t=1738003482\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 Hundreds of unique items to collect, sell, detonate, and equip..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 New mechanics being introduced constantly to keep you on your feet..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 Beat the hell out of people using 12 different combat moves, developed for any type of fighting style..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 Drink 15 consecutive beers and enjoy temporarily enhanced combat at the cost of your vision..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 You can collect birds and put them in a hat and wear it if you want. Should've put this one first in the list..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 there's this dog that eats and deletes all the food in your inventory..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 no guns but you can crack a bottle over someone's head and knock them out I think</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 guns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 you can get drunk and die in a blizzard so be careful when you're drunk and in a blizzard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2023 drink 15 more consecutive beers..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/0de39888adfb68a5496a04f4e0493e4f.poster.avif?t=1738003482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/0de39888adfb68a5496a04f4e0493e4f.webm?t=1738003482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/0de39888adfb68a5496a04f4e0493e4f.mp4?t=1738003482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/7200fe3a9ec1547f783d3755581f5eb9.webp?t=1738003482\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Buckle up and enjoy the ride</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/112d0f9b88ff508f5f39f3546679951a.poster.avif?t=1738003482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/112d0f9b88ff508f5f39f3546679951a.webm?t=1738003482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/112d0f9b88ff508f5f39f3546679951a.mp4?t=1738003482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ralph won't stop until his friends are found. In the meantime, enjoy dozens of unique characters, stories, quests and secrets. RalphGame will have you hollering and screaming for more, I suppose</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/7200fe3a9ec1547f783d3755581f5eb9.webp?t=1738003482\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join the discord on the right side of the Steam page :D</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/78db32aeee90a9ad88b41d613756ec6e.poster.avif?t=1738003482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/78db32aeee90a9ad88b41d613756ec6e.webm?t=1738003482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2008670/extras/78db32aeee90a9ad88b41d613756ec6e.mp4?t=1738003482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
